    "Codex unlocks: gear": "图鉴解锁：装备",
    "Language": "语言",
    "The language of the mod's texts. \"Game language\" follows the game's own setting.": "模组文本的语言。“游戏语言”跟随游戏本身的设置。",
    "Show source": "显示来源",
    "Mark each damage number with where the damage came from: an icon or a short tag (ATK, SKILL, ITEM...).": "在每个伤害数字旁标出伤害来源：图标或简短标签（攻击、技能、道具…）。",
    "Use icons": "使用图标",
    "Use icons instead of text tags where an icon is set (see Damage icons below).": "设置了图标的地方用图标代替文字标签（见下方伤害图标）。",
    "Stay visible": "显示时间",
    "How long a damage number stays fully visible after it pops up (the game's own: about 0.15 s).": "伤害数字出现后完全可见的时长（游戏原本约0.15秒）。",
    "Fade out": "淡出时间",
    "How long a damage number takes to fade out.": "伤害数字淡出所需的时长。",
    "HP numbers": "体力数值",
    "Show current / maximum HP as text on the health bars of bosses, adventurers and dark enemies.": "在首领、冒险家和黑暗敌人的体力条上以文字显示当前/最大体力。",
    "Add your real damage (with your current stats) to the descriptions of skulls, skills, swaps, items, essences and inscriptions.": "在小骨、技能、替换、道具、精华和刻印的说明中加入你的实际伤害（按当前属性）。",
    "Compact numbers": "简洁数值",
    "On: the game's description boxes show one line per attack with its total. Off: every hit with its formula (base x hit % x attack %). The Codex always shows the formula.": "开启：游戏说明框中每种攻击显示一行合计。关闭：每次命中都显示公式（基本 x 命中% x 攻击力%）。图鉴始终显示公式。",
    "Hold to show numbers": "按住时显示数值",
    "The numbers in the game's description boxes show only while you hold the key below, so the boxes stay short. Off: always shown.": "游戏说明框中的数值只在按住下方按键时显示，让说明框保持简短。关闭：始终显示。",
    "Hold key": "按住的按键",
    "The key to hold for the numbers in the inventory, on items on the ground, in shops and in the swap menu. Either Shift works.": "在背包、地上的物品、商店和替换菜单中按住以显示数值的按键。左右Shift都可以。",
    "Pickup preview": "拾取预估",
    "Items on the ground, in shops and in the swap menu show their numbers as if you had picked them up (their stats and inscription steps included).": "地上、商店和替换菜单中的道具显示拾取后的数值（包括其属性和刻印阶段）。",
    "Open / close key": "打开/关闭键",
    "The key that opens and closes the combat log.": "打开和关闭战斗记录的按键。",
    "Dialogue frame": "对话框背景",
    "Use the NPC dialogue box artwork as the window background (off: a plain dark panel).": "用NPC对话框的美术作为窗口背景（关闭：纯色暗面板）。",
    "Background": "背景",
    "How solid the dialogue background is (0% invisible, 100% solid).": "对话框背景的不透明度（0%透明，100%不透明）。",
    "What's new": "更新内容",
    "After an update, show once (in the castle) what's new in this version.": "更新后在城堡中显示一次本版本的更新内容。",
    "Calculations": "计算记录",
    "Record how every hit's number came about (stats, items, inscriptions, dark abilities, crits, debuffs); hover a log line to see it.": "记录每次攻击数值的来由（属性、道具、刻印、黑暗技能、暴击、减益）；将鼠标悬停在记录行上即可查看。",
    "Save to file": "保存到文件",
    "Also write every hit (with its calculation) to BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs, one file per game session (the newest 30 are kept).": "同时把每次攻击（含计算）写入 BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs，每次游戏一个文件（保留最新30个）。",
    "Show mini log": "显示迷你记录",
    "Show a few log lines above the minimap. Can also be switched in the combat log window.": "在小地图上方显示几行记录。也可以在战斗记录窗口中切换。",
    "Lines": "行数",
    "How many lines the mini log shows.": "迷你记录显示的行数。",
    "Hide after": "隐藏延时",
    "Hide the mini log when no new damage came in for this long.": "在这段时间内没有新伤害时隐藏迷你记录。",
    "Pie chart": "饼图",
    "Show a tiny pie chart at the right of the mini log.": "在迷你记录右边显示一个小饼图。",
    "Gap above map": "与地图的间距",
    "Distance between the minimap and the mini log (in pixels at 1920x1080).": "小地图与迷你记录之间的距离（以1920x1080下的像素计）。",
    "Show seconds": "显示秒数",
    "Show the remaining seconds on the skill, swap, quintessence, item and ability icons (83s, 2m+, 10m). Cooldown speed bonuses are included.": "在技能、替换、精华、道具和能力图标上显示剩余秒数（83秒、2分+、10分）。已计入冷却速度加成。",
    "Opacity": "不透明度",
    "How strongly the seconds are drawn.": "秒数显示的浓淡程度。",
    "Record progress": "记录进度",
    "Record your progress for the Codex (enemies met and killed, gear found) and capture enemy pictures.": "为图鉴记录你的进度（遇到和击杀的敌人、找到的装备）并拍下敌人的图像。",
    "The key that opens and closes the Codex book.": "打开和关闭图鉴的按键。",
    "Move hints": "招式提示",
    "Under a boss move in the Codex: when the boss uses it (HP range, distance, cooldown...), read from its AI. Shown once you have beaten the boss.": "在图鉴的首领招式下方显示首领何时使用（体力区间、距离、冷却…），从其AI中读取。击败首领后显示。",
    "Film boss attacks": "录制首领攻击",
    "Film each boss attack once (a small picture 10 times a second, effects included) to show it in the Codex.": "每个首领攻击录制一次（每秒10张小图，含特效），在图鉴中展示。",
    "Projectile pictures": "投射物图像",
    "Add the projectile an enemy fires (arrow, bolt, ...) to its pictures in the Codex, the first time it fires one.": "敌人第一次发射投射物（箭、弩箭等）时，将其加入图鉴中该敌人的图像。",
    "Compact films": "压缩录像",
    "Save boss films as compact pictures (about a quarter of the size, nearly the same look). Off: lossless pictures, about 1 GB more once every boss is filmed.": "以压缩图片保存首领录像（大小约为四分之一，外观几乎相同）。关闭：无损图片，所有首领都录完后约多占1GB。",
    "Open on You": "打开时显示“你”",
    "During a run, the Codex opens on the You page (your skulls, items, inscriptions and stats). Off: it opens on the page you read last.": "冒险途中，图鉴会打开到“你”页面（你的小骨、道具、刻印和属性）。关闭：打开到上次查看的页面。",
    "Slot": "存档位",
    "Left / right: choose a slot. Each slot is a whole game of its own: story, rescued NPCs, the Witch, Dark Mirror, your run and its own Codex.": "左 / 右：选择存档位。每个存档位都是一个完整的独立游戏：剧情、救出的NPC、魔女、魔镜、你的冒险以及它自己的图鉴。",
    "Number of slots": "存档位数量",
    "How many save slots there are (3 to 5).": "存档位的数量（3 到 5）。",
    "Clean films": "干净录像",
    "Boss films show only the boss: damage numbers, the effects of your skills and items, your summons and status effects on the boss (poison, burn, freeze, ...) are left out.": "首领录像只显示首领：伤害数字、你的技能和道具效果、你的召唤物以及首领身上的状态效果（中毒、燃烧、冰冻等）都不会显示。",
    "Window position": "窗口位置",
    "Puts the combat log window back to its default place and size (you can drag it and pull its corners; it remembers where you left it).": "把战斗记录窗口恢复到默认位置和大小（可以拖动窗口、拉动四角调整大小；它会记住你放置的位置）。",
    "Play this slot": "游玩此存档位",
    "Play": "游玩",
    "Switches to the selected slot. Your current game stays in its own slot (a run too, at the room you entered last) and the game goes back to the title screen. An empty slot starts a new game.": "切换到所选存档位。当前游戏保留在它自己的存档位（进行中的冒险也保留在你最后进入的房间），游戏会回到标题画面。空存档位会开始新游戏。",
    "Copy my game here": "将我的游戏复制到这里",
    "Copy": "复制",
    "Copies the game you are playing, with its Codex, into the selected slot. What the slot held is replaced.": "将正在游玩的游戏连同图鉴复制到所选存档位。存档位原有内容会被替换。",
    "Clear this slot": "清空此存档位",
    "Empties the selected slot: its game and its Codex are deleted. The slot you are playing can't be cleared.": "清空所选存档位：其游戏和图鉴都会被清除。正在游玩的存档位无法清空。",
    "Reset Codex": "重置图鉴",
    "Deletes everything the Codex has gathered (progress, films, pictures) the next time the game starts, so you can fill it again from the start. The move notes stay. Select it again before restarting to keep everything.": "下次启动游戏时清除图鉴收集的一切（进度、录像、图片），让你从头开始收集。招式说明会保留。重新启动前再次选择即可全部保留。",
    "All settings": "全部设置",
    "Reset everything": "全部重置",
    "Puts every setting on this page back to its default. Your Codex progress stays as it is.": "把本页的所有设置恢复为默认值。你的图鉴进度保持不变。",
    "Takes effect in the Codex at once.": "立即在图鉴中生效。",
    "On": "开",
    "Off": "关",
    "Not set": "未设置",
    "Select it and press the new key (Esc keeps the old one).": "选中后按下新按键（Esc保留原按键）。",
    "The icon next to {0} damage numbers. \"Text tag\" shows a short word instead (ATK, SKILL, ITEM...). Other icons (skill:Name, item:Name...) can be typed into the config file.": "{0}伤害数字旁的图标。“文字标签”改为显示简短文字（攻击、技能、道具…）。其他图标（skill:名称、item:名称…）可写入配置文件。",
    "Game language": "游戏语言",
    "Basic attacks": "普通攻击",
    "Other statuses": "其他异常状态",
    "Text tag": "文字标签",
    "At the next start": "下次启动时",
    "Play slot {0}? Your current game stays in slot {1}. The game goes back to the title screen.": "游玩存档位 {0}？当前游戏保留在存档位 {1}。游戏会回到标题画面。",
    "Start a new game in slot {0}? Your current game stays in slot {1}. The game goes back to the title screen.": "在存档位 {0} 开始新游戏？当前游戏保留在存档位 {1}。游戏会回到标题画面。",
    "Replace slot {0} with a copy of your game (and its Codex)?": "用你的游戏（及其图鉴）的副本替换存档位 {0}？",
    "Copy your game (and its Codex) into slot {0}?": "将你的游戏（及其图鉴）复制到存档位 {0}？",
    "Copying your game into slot {0}...": "正在将你的游戏复制到存档位 {0}...",
    "Clear slot {0}? Its game and its Codex are deleted.": "清空存档位 {0}？其游戏和图鉴都会被清除。",
    "Delete everything the Codex has gathered (progress, films, pictures) the next time the game starts?": "下次启动游戏时清除图鉴收集的一切（进度、录像、图片）吗？",
